## How to test

```bash
php spark modules:sync              # namespace, migrations, permissions, settings, assets
php spark permissions:check
vendor/bin/phpunit modules/Notes
```

By hand: `php spark modules:demo Notes`, then `<back office>/notes` (`backend_path('notes')`) with a user of the `admin` group.
